    "status": "Underwriting submission prepared for Santam via Indwe. No revised policy is bound on these terms as at August 2026.",
    "_structureNote": "Per-swing premium, exactly the Santam submission: every insured swing cedes 24% on the swing that creates the risk. The membership's one included swing a month is priced the same way — $0.80 expected claim grossed up at the 31.9% loss ratio is $2.51 ceded per swing taken. The allowance is underwritable BECAUSE it is capped at one: at four included swings the ceded premium reaches $10.03 on a $10 membership, and an uncapped allowance has premium fixed while exposure runs unbounded. One swing, priced. Never more, never unlimited.",
